From: ITSMEFRTRUST <215584995+ITSMEFRTRUST@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:29:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 023/138] clk: Add a driver for the Apple A8 touch clock

Add a driver for the TOUCH_CTL clock in the A8 PMGR, using the same
sequence as iOS: ungate, wait 8 us, program the divider (0x2dc) and the
enable bit, then wait for the busy bit to clear.

Tested on the iPhone 6 (N61) together with the touchscreen.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
